cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this agent skill, please cite it using this metadata.
  The references acknowledge the sources informing its guidance;
  their authors are not credited as authors of this skill.
title: "AXI — Agent eXperience Interface skill"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: ibuchanan
abstract: >-
  An agent skill for designing, implementing, reviewing, and retrofitting
  shell-facing CLI interfaces using contextual AXI principles. Guidance
  covers task-appropriate output, compatibility, actionable failures,
  safe backend substitutes for tests, and optional session integrations.
keywords:
  - agent skills
  - AXI
  - command-line interfaces
  - agent experience
